                    <span class="text-sm text-white/90">9/10</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              {# date stays right #}
              <span class="text-sm hidden lg:block text-uwais-muted shrink-0">3 Dec 2025</span>
            </div>

            <p class="mt-5 text-base text-uwais-muted leading-relaxed">
              really Good, I swear, this is an Indonesian action film, wow, it's not just any old film, it's full of blood, just like the title, I think it's good because it's interspersed with comedy but the action is also good, the plot is also okay, especially the experience of watching this film in Jaff yesterday and the producer was sitting next to me, so I was like, this is a really cool film, toppp!
            </p>
          </article>

          {# CARD 2 #}
