            <p class="mt-5 text-base text-uwais-muted leading-relaxed">
              I'd say this film is on par with The Raid. It's truly insane how Sidharta Tata could orchestrate such a brutal film. I absolutely adore the fighting choreography; it's engaging throughout. Livi Ciananta once again delivers her best acting and fisticuffs in an action film.
